{"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/Semiring","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/SQ","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/SH","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CountingSemiring","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Numeric","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sj","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With unit weights, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dagShortestDistances"},{"type":"text","text":" counts the paths. With other weights it sums, over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every path, the product of the path’s weights, which is the probability semiring when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"weights are probabilities."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"zero"},{"type":"text","text":" is 0, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"one"},{"type":"text","text":" is 1, ⊕ is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"+"},{"type":"text","text":" and ⊗ is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*"},{"type":"text","text":". It is not selective, because ⊕ is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"idempotent ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a ⊕ a == 2a"},{"type":"text","text":"), and not "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Comparable"},{"type":"text","text":", so only "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dagShortestDistances"},{"type":"text","text":" takes it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" both operations trap on overflow, like every sum in ShortestPaths, because a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"saturated or wrapped count would be silently wrong. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int.max"},{"type":"text","text":" paths fit: 2⁶³ − 1, or 2³¹ − 1 where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" is 32 bits. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"type":"text","text":" rounds past 2⁵³."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For exact large counts, use any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Numeric & Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":" big-integer type."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["dag.dagShortestDistances(from: s) { _ in CountingSemiring(1) }"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/CountingSemiring\/init(_:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/CountingSemiring\/value"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/CountingSemiring\/plus(_:)","doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/CountingSemiring\/times(_:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/CountingSemiring\/one","doc:\/\/Sem